We can search for keywords and phrases that indicate the realization that the planet is not what it seems and that they are not alone. Some examples of such keywords and phrases are "realization," "planet is not what it seems," "not alone," and "aliens." We can use the `std::find` function from the C++ standard library to search for these keywords and phrases.
