Step 5: Identify the sub-genre of the novel
Based on the presence of the keywords and phrases identified in the previous steps, we can identify the sub-genre of the novel. If the novel contains keywords and phrases related to space exploration, aliens, and potential sinister plots, we can classify it as a science fiction thriller.
