}
Step 5: Automating the Process with R Code
Create a function that automates the entire process by calling the previous functions in the correct order. The function should only move on to the next step if the previous step was successfully completed.
party_planning_process <- function() {
  if(language_puzzle()) {
    if(math_puzzle()) {
      if(logic_puzzle()) {
        if(social_media_challenge()) {
